{
  "$comment": [
    "SHARED DECIDE-LANE CATEGORY PARITY CORPUS (spaarkeai-mcp-bff-api-r1 task 022; spec FR-03).",
    "",
    "WHY THIS FILE EXISTS. The Console's Decide-lane category cards are computed in the browser by bucketLaneItems",
    "(src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/Worklist/laneCountFilters.ts). The MCP tool",
    "spaarke_show_decisions tells Copilot the same counts, computed on the server by DecideLaneCategories",
    "(src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Api/Mcp/LegalOperations/Decisions/DecideLaneCategories.cs). Two hand-kept copies of the",
    "expectations could drift while both suites stay green; this file is the single set of expectations, and each side",
    "runs it against its own code, so a divergence fails on the side that lags.",
    "",
    "READERS. tests/unit/domain/Mcp/DecideLaneCategoriesParityTests.cs (xunit) and",
    "src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/Worklist/__tests__/laneCountFilters.parity.test.ts (jest).",
    "Moving this file means moving it in both readers.",
    "",
    "SHAPE. Each case lists items (lane, workType, invoiceReview) and the Decide lane's expected cards in display order",
    "(key, label, count). invoiceReview is null or an object with a guid invoiceId (the server always writes one), so",
    "'billing' means the same thing on both sides. A key or label change in either partition must change this file.",
    "",
    "MAINTENANCE. A new Decide-lane work type, a new card, or a change to which items a card holds adds or changes a case here."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "empty lane: All and every work-type card at zero, no Invoice decisions or Other card",
      "items": [],
      "expected": [
        { "key": "all", "label": "All", "count": 0 },
        { "key": "askOutsideCounsel", "label": "Ask outside counsel", "count": 0 },
        { "key": "approveOrRebudget", "label": "Approve or rebudget", "count": 0 },
        { "key": "chaseReply", "label": "Chase a reply", "count": 0 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "one item per work type, no billing, no other",
      "items": [
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "askOutsideCounsel", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "askOutsideCounsel", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "approveOrRebudget", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "chaseReply", "invoiceReview": null }
      ],
      "expected": [
        { "key": "all", "label": "All", "count": 4 },
        { "key": "askOutsideCounsel", "label": "Ask outside counsel", "count": 2 },
        { "key": "approveOrRebudget", "label": "Approve or rebudget", "count": 1 },
        { "key": "chaseReply", "label": "Chase a reply", "count": 1 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "billing items go to Invoice decisions right after All and leave the work-type cards, whatever their work type",
      "items": [
        {
          "lane": "Decide",
          "workType": "approveOrRebudget",
          "invoiceReview": {
            "invoiceId": "0b5ad0a8-3f0e-4c7f-9a51-1d2e3f405162",
            "lineId": "7c1e2d3f-4a5b-4c6d-8e9f-a0b1c2d3e4f5"
          }
        },
        {
          "lane": "Decide",
          "workType": "approveOrRebudget",
          "invoiceReview": { "invoiceId": "1b5ad0a8-3f0e-4c7f-9a51-1d2e3f405162", "lineId": null }
        },
        {
          "lane": "Decide",
          "workType": null,
          "invoiceReview": { "invoiceId": "2b5ad0a8-3f0e-4c7f-9a51-1d2e3f405162" }
        },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "approveOrRebudget", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "chaseReply", "invoiceReview": null }
      ],
      "expected": [
        { "key": "all", "label": "All", "count": 5 },
        { "key": "invoiceDecisions", "label": "Invoice decisions", "count": 3 },
        { "key": "askOutsideCounsel", "label": "Ask outside counsel", "count": 0 },
        { "key": "approveOrRebudget", "label": "Approve or rebudget", "count": 1 },
        { "key": "chaseReply", "label": "Chase a reply", "count": 1 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Other holds every non-billing item whose work type is missing, empty, unknown, of the Do lane or differently cased",
      "items": [
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": null, "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "comingDue", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "somethingNew", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "AskOutsideCounsel", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "askOutsideCounsel", "invoiceReview": null }
      ],
      "expected": [
        { "key": "all", "label": "All", "count": 7 },
        { "key": "askOutsideCounsel", "label": "Ask outside counsel", "count": 1 },
        { "key": "approveOrRebudget", "label": "Approve or rebudget", "count": 0 },
        { "key": "chaseReply", "label": "Chase a reply", "count": 0 },
        { "key": "other", "label": "Other", "count": 6 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Do-lane items (billing or not) are not in the Decide lane's cards",
      "items": [
        { "lane": "Do", "workType": "finishOrReschedule", "invoiceReview": null },
        {
          "lane": "Do",
          "workType": "askOutsideCounsel",
          "invoiceReview": { "invoiceId": "3b5ad0a8-3f0e-4c7f-9a51-1d2e3f405162" }
        },
        { "lane": "decide", "workType": "chaseReply", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "chaseReply", "invoiceReview": null }
      ],
      "expected": [
        { "key": "all", "label": "All", "count": 1 },
        { "key": "askOutsideCounsel", "label": "Ask outside counsel", "count": 0 },
        { "key": "approveOrRebudget", "label": "Approve or rebudget", "count": 0 },
        { "key": "chaseReply", "label": "Chase a reply", "count": 1 }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "every card at once: the non-All cards partition the lane (their counts sum to All)",
      "items": [
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "askOutsideCounsel", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "approveOrRebudget", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "approveOrRebudget", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "chaseReply", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "chaseReply", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "chaseReply", "invoiceReview": null },
        {
          "lane": "Decide",
          "workType": "askOutsideCounsel",
          "invoiceReview": {
            "invoiceId": "4b5ad0a8-3f0e-4c7f-9a51-1d2e3f405162",
            "lineId": "8c1e2d3f-4a5b-4c6d-8e9f-a0b1c2d3e4f5"
          }
        },
        { "lane": "Decide", "workType": "finishOrReschedule", "invoiceReview": null },
        { "lane": "Do", "workType": "comingDue", "invoiceReview": null }
      ],
      "expected": [
        { "key": "all", "label": "All", "count": 8 },
        { "key": "invoiceDecisions", "label": "Invoice decisions", "count": 1 },
        { "key": "askOutsideCounsel", "label": "Ask outside counsel", "count": 1 },
        { "key": "approveOrRebudget", "label": "Approve or rebudget", "count": 2 },
        { "key": "chaseReply", "label": "Chase a reply", "count": 3 },
        { "key": "other", "label": "Other", "count": 1 }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
